4	\N	\N	2026-05-29 09:45:16.732305	1		{"en_US": ""}	account_edi	Odoo S.A.	/base/static/description/icon.png	uninstalled	\N	{"en_US": "Import/Export Invoices From XML/PDF", "es_ES": "Importar/Exportar facturas desde XML/PDF"}	2	{"en_US": "\\nElectronic Data Interchange\\n=======================================\\nEDI is the electronic interchange of business information using a standardized format.\\n\\nThis is the base module for import and export of invoices in various EDI formats, and the\\nthe transmission of said documents to various parties involved in the exchange (other company,\\ngovernements, etc.)\\n", "es_ES": "\\nIntercambio electrónico de datos\\n=======================================\\nEDI (Electronic Data Interchange) es el intercambio electrónico de información comercial utilizando un formato estandarizado.\\n\\nEste es el módulo base para la importación y exportación de facturas en varios formatos EDI y\\nla transmisión de dichos documentos a varias partes involucradas en el intercambio (otra empresa,\\ngobiernos, etc.)\\n"}	f	f	f	LGPL-3	100	f	f	\N	\N	\N	\N				official	\N
