277	\N	\N	2026-05-29 09:45:16.732305	1	https://www.odoo.com/documentation/latest/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania.html	{"en_US": ""}	l10n_ro	Fekete Mihai (NextERP Romania SRL), Odoo S.A.	/account/static/description/l10n.png	uninstalled	\N	{"en_US": "Romania - Accounting", "es_ES": "Rumania - Contabilidad"}	37	{"en_US": "\\nThis is the module to manage the Accounting Chart, VAT structure, Fiscal Position and Tax Mapping.\\nIt also adds the Registration Number for Romania in Odoo.\\n================================================================================================================\\n\\nRomanian accounting chart and localization.\\n", "es_ES": "\\nEste es el módulo para gestionar el plan contable, la estructura del IVA, la situación fiscal y el mapeo de impuestos.\\nTambién añade el número de registro de Rumania en Odoo.\\n================================================================================================================\\n\\nPlan contable y localización rumanos.\\n"}	f	f	f	LGPL-3	100	t	f	\N	\N	\N	\N				official	\N
